Ask three Cardiff web designers for a price and you'll probably get three very different answers. That isn't always because someone's overcharging. "A website" can mean a single page explaining who you are, or a large site with dozens of service pages and an online shop.

This guide covers what drives the cost, what you get at each level, and what a website costs to *run* once it's live. I've included our own published prices so you've got real numbers to compare against. I've also been upfront about terms and ownership, because those are the things people most often wish they'd asked about.

